From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] spi: spidev: add the MaxLinear PEF32001

The PEF32001 (DUSLIC-XS1) is a single-channel SLIC. Its firmware download,
calibration and line control run in a userspace voice stack, the way the
Silicon Labs Si3210 already listed here is driven, so bind it to spidev.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
---
Index: linux-6.18.60/drivers/spi/spidev.c
===================================================================
--- linux-6.18.60.orig/drivers/spi/spidev.c
+++ linux-6.18.60/drivers/spi/spidev.c
@@ -694,6 +694,7 @@
 	{ .name = /* lwn */ "bk4" },
 	{ .name = /* lwn */ "bk4-spi" },
 	{ .name = /* menlo */ "m53cpld" },
+	{ .name = /* maxlinear */ "pef32001" },
 	{ .name = /* micron */ "spi-authenta" },
 	{ .name = /* rohm */ "bh2228fv" },
 	{ .name = /* rohm */ "dh2228fv" },
@@ -727,6 +728,7 @@
 	{ .compatible = "lwn,bk4", .data = &spidev_of_check },
 	{ .compatible = "lwn,bk4-spi", .data = &spidev_of_check },
 	{ .compatible = "menlo,m53cpld", .data = &spidev_of_check },
+	{ .compatible = "maxlinear,pef32001", .data = &spidev_of_check },
 	{ .compatible = "micron,spi-authenta", .data = &spidev_of_check },
 	{ .compatible = "rohm,bh2228fv", .data = &spidev_of_check },
 	{ .compatible = "rohm,dh2228fv", .data = &spidev_of_check },
